# Target C support-seven H6: exact state-level reflection closure

Date: 2026-09-19

Status: exact finite reduction inside the generic H6 branch. The theorem-state authority is unchanged. C-II remains open.

## Result

The previous explicit exact generic-H6 endpoint is

\[
4704=3760\,C_7+944\,(C_3\sqcup C_4).
\]

The earlier reflection argument used only aggregate ground-pattern counts and therefore gave the conservative bound

\[
|S_{H6}^{\rm refl}|\le 4582.
\]

The state-level reflection map can now be constructed on the complete exact 14,174-state H6 universe. Closing the 4,704-cell exact survivor set under this involution gives

\[
\boxed{4464=3580\,C_7+884\,(C_3\sqcup C_4)}.
\]

Thus reflection transfers already certified branch exclusions to exactly

\[
\boxed{240}
\]

additional labelled H6 states. This is an explicit exact survivor census, not only a counting upper bound.

